eytek-2012:p0414:b003:l034","ordinal":327401,"en":"Three times a week,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0414:b003:l035","ordinal":327402,"en":"Destroying the living air"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0414:b003:l036","ordinal":327403,"en":"To cause a lot of pain,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0414:b003:l037","ordinal":327404,"en":"Have I been naughty,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0414:b003:l038","ordinal":327405,"en":"Do not run away from the referee"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0414:b003:l039","ordinal":327406,"en":"Did I touch it?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0414:b003:l040","ordinal":327407,"en":"Did I really think about the property?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0415:b002:l001","ordinal":327408,"en":"Flowing spring water cries,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0415:b002:l002","ordinal":327409,"en":"Weeping grass of the Albanian variety,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0415:b002:l003","ordinal":327410,"en":"Argyn, Kyrgyz cry a lot,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0415:b002:l004","ordinal":327411,"en":"Crying souls are creatures"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0415:b002:l005","ordinal":327412,"en":"Eat your sorrows and cry"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0415:b002:l006","ordinal":327413,"en":"To all living beings,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0415:b002:l007","ordinal":327414,"en":"If there is too much trouble,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0415:b002:l008","ordinal":327415,"en":"Amanat gives strength to the soul,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0415:b002:l009","ordinal":327416,"en":"If the problem ends,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0415:b002:l010","ordinal":327417,"en":"If the accident is not serious,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0415:b002:l011","ordinal":327418,"en":"If it doesn't stop,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0415:b002:l012","ordinal":327419,"en":"If you want strength to build a soul,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0415:b002:l013","ordinal":327420,"en":"If all hell comes to an end,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0415:b002:l014","ordinal":327421,"en":"The created soul cannot be healed,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0415:b002:l015","ordinal":327422,"en":"Goodness is not close -"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0415:b002:l016","ordinal":327423,"en":"Kadirman weeps, the earth weeps,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0415:b002:l017","ordinal":327424,"en":"At this, the Black giant wrestler cried."}]
